&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Complete comprehensive reviews of incoming customer onboarding cases and ensuring that the application of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;KYB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; principles are consistent with the Company’s KYB policy and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;customer risk assessment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
