descriptions.job-0beuebo:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior sales hunter to join our mission in eliminating financial crime. This role is singular in its focus: new logo acquisition. You&#39;ll own the full new business cycle from building your territory strategy and generating pipeline to closing high-value deals with Fintechs, Banks, and Payment companies. We provide the tech and the infrastructure; you bring the strategic vision, the relentless drive, and a proven ability to open and close net new business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Hunt (New Business):&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll own your pipeline from the ground up, building and executing a territory strategy that drives consistent, compounding new business. You&#39;ll partner closely with your BDR to align on target accounts, coordinate outreach cadences, and run a joint coverage model. Pipeline doesn&#39;t happen to you; you build the system that creates it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Close:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll lead the full sales cycle: qualifying, negotiating, and closing high-value deals with a focus on creating urgency and winning net new logos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll build and own a territory plan from day one: identifying your ICP, tiering your accounts, and defining how you and your BDR will work in concert to penetrate the market. You&#39;ll feed market intelligence back to our Product teams and help elevate junior sales members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Goal:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently overachieve on new business quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven track record (8+ years) in B2B SaaS sales with a focus on new business. You&#39;ve built a pipeline from scratch and closed net new logos consistently and you have the numbers to prove it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in Fintech, RegTech, or Financial Services is a huge plus. If you know AML, Compliance, or Transaction Monitoring, you&#39;ll hit the ground running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re a fan of standardized sales processes (think MEDDICC, Sandler, or Challenger) and use them to navigate complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a demonstrated ability to build a pipeline independently and not just work inbound or handed leads. You know how to develop a territory strategy, prioritize accounts, and run a consistent outbound motion quarter over quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BDR Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve operated in a model where you co-own pipeline generation with a BDR. You know how to set shared targets, align on ICP and messaging, and run a coordinated outreach strategy and not just assign a list and wait for results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in entrepreneurial environments, think on your feet, and are always looking for ways to do things better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our values describe how we operate, and they map closely to this role:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make a safer world:&lt;/strong&gt; Every role here contributes to financial systems that are harder for criminals to exploit. You will keep the customer and the real-world outcome of our work visible in everything the team does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar:&lt;/strong&gt; We set ambitious standards and pursue them with discipline, never settling for good enough. You will raise the bar on the team&#39;s capability and craft, and balance that ambition with care for the people behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See it, own it, drive it forward: &lt;/strong&gt;We notice what needs to change, take personal responsibility, and move with purpose. You will lead with a bias for action and see things through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win as one team:&lt;/strong&gt; Financial crime is complex and global, and no function solves it alone. You will build trust and shared goals across Customer Success, Sales, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity as we want you to have a part of what we are building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Time Off Policy- A work-life balance and focus on our well-being are critical to keeping us performing at our best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual learning budget to drive your performance and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget to set up your home office upon joining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave and childcare benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Insurance to protect your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical (100%), Dental (90%), and Vision (80%) contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Accounts (FSA) to allow you to use tax free dollars for healthcare or day care related expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Perks (Support with student loan, PerkSpot discounts, Pet Insurance discounts, Travel assistance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-Tax transit benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role is $200,000 - 250,000 OTC, equity, and US benefits. The actual pay may vary based on factors such as location, experience, and skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to empower every business to eliminate financial crime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By harnessing AI, a unified platform, and an extensive partner ecosystem, we help customers turn compliance into a catalyst for growth, operational resilience, and enduring regulatory trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 3,000 enterprises across 75 countries rely on our end-to-end platform and the world’s most comprehensive financial crime risk intelligence. With full-stack agentic automation, we help organizations automate up to 95% of KYC, AML, and sanctions reviews, cut onboarding times by 50%, reduce false positives by 70%, and handle 7x more work with the same staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ComplyAdvantage is headquartered in London and has global hubs in New York, Lisbon, Singapore, and Cluj-Napoca. It is backed by Balderton Capital, Index Ventures, Ontario Teachers’ Pension Plan, Goldman Sachs, and Andreessen Horowitz. Learn more about compliance re-engineered for the age of AI at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://complyadvantage.com&quot;&gt;complyadvantage.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1dhko5g:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Lead Digital Designer to help shape the future of our web ecosystem. This role goes beyond designing pages, it’s about building scalable systems, defining modern digital experiences, and driving how our brand shows up across the web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a key role in evolving our design foundations, contributing to a large-scale website redesign, and partnering closely with engineering, product, marketing, and agencies to deliver thoughtful, high-impact experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role for someone who thinks in systems, cares deeply about craft, and knows how to bring clarity to complex, cross-functional work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with design systems and component-based design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong design foundation (layout, typography, color, hierarchy, motion, interaction, 3D)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop polished, modern, and high-quality digital experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of responsive design, UX principles, and web protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across design, engineering, and product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who can explain decisions and influence direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity and helping define the path forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to zoom out to define direction, and zoom in to complete details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of high-impact web experiences across homepage, product pages, and key user journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of a scalable design system, including tokens, components, and reusable modules for CMS system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering to ensure design systems are translated into high-quality, production-ready implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and refine site architecture, navigation systems, and overall user experience frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with brand teams to develop a modern and cohesive digital aesthetic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance brand storytelling with usability, accessibility, and performance across all web experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product, marketing, and UX teams to align on goals, priorities, and user needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and collaborate with external agencies and partners on design execution and exploration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support UX testing, A/B testing, and ongoing optimization efforts to continuously improve the site experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish workflows and processes that improve speed, quality, and consistency across the web team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3+ years experience in web or digital product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio demonstrating high-quality web design and systems thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with design systems, component libraries, and scalable frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual design foundation, including typography, layout, color, and hierarchy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of responsive design, UX principles, and modern web standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with engineering teams and an understanding of front-end constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to clearly communicate design decisions and influence cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in fast-paced environments with evolving priorities and ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for complex, multi-page websites or platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, B2B, or complex product ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools and workflows such as Storybook, design tokens, or system-driven development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or leading large-scale website redesigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of CRO, A/B testing, and data-informed design decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with motion design, interaction design, or advanced web storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI tools and their application in design workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with or managing external agencies and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to both brand-driven and product-driven design environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;For positions that will be based in NY, the annual salary range for this position is below. Actual salaries may vary based on numerous factors including, among other things, an individual applicant’s experience and qualifications for the position. This range does not include equity or additional compensation, such as bonuses or commissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NY Annual Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
