&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X1oGdjPR4o0XzZxn64tlErnbgAh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate closely with the R&amp;amp;D team to manage the product iteration process, ensuring it follows the planned schedule.&lt;/div&gt;
