&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;About The Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextContainer text-align-left&quot; data-partial-quote-enabled=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Q2KgdAwZrok9ivxWH1VlELmwgyc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlged9wauGRPLXaCLneYrRmzd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;The DEX Token Markets team at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; Web3 empowers users with a robust, data-driven platform designed for real-time market tracking and analysis across multiple DEXs and blockchains. Our platform provides traders with essential tools such as real-time charts, trade feeds, customizable token watchlists, price alerts, and advanced screeners that track key metrics like volume, price changes, and liquidity. With support for over 40 chains and hundreds of thousands of trading pairs, we offer one of the most comprehensive decentralized market monitoring solutions available. Trusted by millions of traders worldwide, our platform is an indispensable resource for navigating the fast-paced world of crypto trading and investment. As part of this team, you’ll contribute to building high-impact products that help users make smarter trading decisions in the decentralized ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextContainer text-align-left&quot; data-partial-quote-enabled=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
