&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;2. Develop high-throughput, low-latency backend systems, and optimize them to keep the data accurate, timely, and reliable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;3. Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues to ensure the stability and quality of our services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;4. Deliver assigned features and projects with quality and on time, writing clean, well-tested, maintainable code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5. Collaborate with product and other engineering teams to support their needs and keep integrations running smoothly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-OL1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;1. Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field (or a strong STEM education background).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;2. 3-5+ years of extensive experience designing, building, and operating high-performance systems in Java, with a deep understanding of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;JVM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, IO, multithreading, concurrency, and networking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;3. Familiar with databases like&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, with a deep understanding of transactions and indexing and hands-on experience in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; optimization; well-acquainted with frequently-used middleware such as caching and message queues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;4. Thorough command of common data structures, algorithms, and design patterns, with good coding norms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5. Clear logic, strong learning and communication skills, a passion for technology, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;23&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;1. Proven experience designing and developing distributed systems, with a solid grasp of core principles such as consistency, high availability, fault tolerance, and horizontal scalability applied to high-throughput data platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;2. Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;DEX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; mechanics and the broader Web3 ecosystem, ideally as a hands-on user or active trader, bringing genuine product intuition and a deep passion for decentralized finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
